<div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-title-bar"><span>Admission Procedure</span><span class="badge badge-green">Procedure Guide</span></div>
    <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">This page provides you information on how to apply for admission in Shah Abdul Latif University.</p>
    <div style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; color:#334155;">
        <h4 style="color:var(--navy);">Step 1: Account Registration</h4>
        <p>Register online with your valid CNIC/B-Form and verify your email.</p>
        <h4 style="color:var(--navy);">Step 2: Fill Online Application Form</h4>
        <p>Complete Personal Information, Academic History, and Document Uploads.</p>
        <h4 style="color:var(--navy);">Step 3: Deposit Processing Fee</h4>
        <p>Generate fee challan (PKR 2,200) and deposit in any HBL branch or via HBL Konnect.</p>
        <h4 style="color:var(--navy);">Step 4: Entrance Test &amp; Merit Lists</h4>
        <p>Appear in the pre-admission entry test on the notified date and check merit list standing.</p>
    </div>
</div>

